  IDFT[ H[k] ] = h[n] = N^{-1} sum_{k = 0}^{N - 1} H_k e^{i 2pi k n / N}
  ```

  From these definitions, we see that

  ```
  H[0] = sum_{n = 0}^{N - 1} h_n
  H[1] = "the first positive frequency"
  H[N - 1] = "the first negative frequency"
